  },
  "description": "Quick overview\nThis workflow lets users upload PDFs or ask questions in Telegram, indexes PDF content in Pinecone using Google Gemini embeddings, and answers follow-up questions with a Google Gemini chat model using retrieval-augmented generation formatted for Telegram HTML.\n\nHow it works\nTriggers when a new Telegram message is received by your bot.\nChecks whether the message includes a document; if it does, it downloads the file from Telegram and forces the binary metadata to application/pdf.\nSplits the PDF text into overlapping chunks, generates embeddings with Google Gemini, and inserts the vectors into a Pinecone index.\nSends a Telegram confirmation message indicating how many PDF pages were saved to Pinecone.\nIf the message is a text question, retrieves relevant context from the Pinecone index and uses the Google Gemini chat model to generate an answer constrained to that context.\nSends the generated answer back to Telegram using HTML parse mode formatting.\n\nSetup\nCreate a Telegram bot with BotFather and add Telegram credentials in n8n for the Telegram Trigger and Telegram nodes.\nAdd a Google Gemini (PaLM) API credential for both the embeddings and chat model nodes.\nSet up a Pinecone account, create (or select) an index named telegram, and add your Pinecone credentials in n8n.\nActivate the workflow and start a chat with your Telegram bot to upload a PDF for indexing and then send text questions to query it.\n\nRequirements\nn8n Instance & Required Nodes: An active n8n account (Cloud or self-hosted).\nTelegram Account: A Telegram bot created via the BotFather, along with its API token.\nGoogle Gemini AI Account: A Google Cloud account with the Vertex AI API enabled and an associated API Key.\nPinecone Account: A Pinecone account with an API key.\n\nAdditional info\nConnect with us:\nWebsite: https://www.intuz.com/n8n-workflow-automation-templates/\nEmail: getstarted@intuz.com\nLinkedIn: https://www.linkedin.com/company/intuz\n\nFor Custom Workflow Automation\nGet Started: https://n8n.partnerlinks.io/intuz",
